# The build context is the repo root (see deploy/compose.yml). Keep it to what
# deploy/Dockerfile copies, and never let a local .env into an image.
**/.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
**/.claude
**/.DS_Store
*.dump
.agents
.entire
landing
frontend/dist
ai/fight_videos
ai/runs
ai/frames
ai/*.pt
